# ==============================================================================
# CODEVERSE – Supabase Environment Configuration (Optional)
# ==============================================================================
# The website works 100% out-of-the-box in offline "Demo Mode" with realistic data!
# If you wish to connect a live Supabase backend, provide your project credentials:

# 1. Supabase Project URL (e.g., https://your-project-id.supabase.co)
CODEVERSE_SUPABASE_URL="https://your-project.supabase.co"

# 2. Supabase Anon Public Key
CODEVERSE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."

# Instructions:
# - You can enter these values in your hosting dashboard (Vercel, Netlify)
# - Alternatively, in the browser console or via localStorage:
#     localStorage.setItem('codeverse_supabase_url', 'YOUR_URL')
#     localStorage.setItem('codeverse_supabase_anon_key', 'YOUR_KEY')
